sequenceDiagram
    participant Client
    participant AuthController
    participant AuthService
    participant RefreshTokenRepository
    participant JwtTokenProvider
    participant Database

    Client->>AuthController: POST /api/v1/auth/refresh<br/>{refreshToken}
    AuthController->>AuthService: refreshToken(RefreshTokenRequest)

    AuthService->>RefreshTokenRepository: findByToken(refreshToken)
    RefreshTokenRepository->>Database: SELECT * FROM refresh_tokens WHERE token = ?
    Database-->>RefreshTokenRepository: Optional<RefreshToken>
    RefreshTokenRepository-->>AuthService: RefreshToken or empty

    alt Token not found
        AuthService-->>AuthController: throw BusinessException("Invalid refresh token")
        AuthController-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    alt Token expired
        AuthService->>RefreshTokenRepository: delete(RefreshToken)
        RefreshTokenRepository->>Database: DELETE FROM refresh_tokens WHERE id = ?
        Database-->>RefreshTokenRepository: OK
        AuthService-->>AuthController: throw BusinessException("Refresh token expired")
        AuthController-->>Client: 400 Bad Request
    end

    Note right of AuthService: Token rotation:<br/>Delete old token,<br/>issue new pair

    AuthService->>RefreshTokenRepository: delete(RefreshToken)
    RefreshTokenRepository->>Database: DELETE FROM refresh_tokens WHERE id = ?
    Database-->>RefreshTokenRepository: OK
    RefreshTokenRepository-->>AuthService: OK

    Note right of AuthService: Generate new token pair

    AuthService->>JwtTokenProvider: generateAccessToken(userId, email, role)
    JwtTokenProvider-->>AuthService: new JWT access token

    AuthService->>JwtTokenProvider: generateRefreshToken(userId)
    JwtTokenProvider-->>AuthService: new JWT refresh token

    AuthService->>RefreshTokenRepository: save(RefreshToken)
    RefreshTokenRepository->>Database: INSERT INTO refresh_tokens (user_id, token, expires_at) VALUES (?, ?, ?)
    Database-->>RefreshTokenRepository: RefreshToken
    RefreshTokenRepository-->>AuthService: saved RefreshToken

    AuthService-->>AuthController: AuthResponse(newAccessToken, newRefreshToken, user)
    AuthController-->>Client: 200 OK<br/>{message: "Token refreshed", data: {accessToken, refreshToken, user}}
